WEBVTT

00:09:59.079 --> 00:10:01.412
They are all rigid responses.

00:10:02.912 --> 00:10:05.246
And if there's a single lesson
we can learn from

00:10:05.246 --> 00:10:10.662
the inevitable fall of apartheid, it
is that rigid denial doesn't work.

00:10:11.996 --> 00:10:18.454
It's unsustainable. For individuals,
for families, for societies,

00:10:19.162 --> 00:10:25.996
and as we watch the ice caps melt. It
is unsustainable for our planet.

00:10:28.246 --> 00:10:31.662
Research on emotional suppression shows
that when emotions are pushed aside